    <string name="good_morning">早上好</string>
    <string name="track_card_icon_desc">轻触静音，长按逐渐淡出</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_1">欢迎来到 SoundSlumber</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_1">定制您的专属助眠环境音，帮助您更快入睡，整晚睡得更香甜深沉。</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_2">声学防护</string>
    <string name="onboarding_desc_2">开启省电模式在夜间节省电量，启用音量均衡功能防止音频忽大忽小产生爆音。</string>
